---
title: Rates and quotes
description: Prices for a route, and binding quotes for a shipment.
---

The [Rates API](/apis/rates) is public: anyone can ask what shipping costs.

{% callout type="tip" title="No sign-in needed" %}
The consoles on this page work while you're signed out. They send requests to the mock server on your machine.
{% /callout %}

## Compare services for a route

`GET /rates` lists every service level that covers the route, cheapest first.

{% api-operation spec="rates" path="/rates" method="get" /%}

## Lock a price with a quote

A quote is binding for 30 minutes. Pass its `id` as `quote_id` when you create the shipment.

{% api-operation spec="rates" path="/rates/quote" method="post" /%}

## Where we deliver

{% api-operation spec="rates" path="/coverage/{country}" method="get" /%}
